  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "98 KITCHENER ROAD, MILFORD\r\n\r\nThis is an outstanding opportunity to secure a brand-new residence in one of North Shore’s most tightly held neighbourhoods. A short walk will have you at the shops in no time - everything this fantastic location offers is literally at your fingertips. \r\n\r\nOur successful purchaser of Lot 2 will receive TWO FREE Sinch e-bikes valued at over $10,000, together with a FREE EV wall charger for your EV vehicle valued at over $1,000. This is the perfect complement to Milford's effortless coastal lifestyle, meaning you can cycle into Takapuna, or even Devonport and take the ferry into town with ease.\r\n\r\n- Designed by BDG Architects, this brand-new 216sqm residence, with double side-by-side garaging, offers superb living and functionality, including a lift to all floors. \r\n\r\n- This beautifully crafted property combines contemporary architecture with warm natural materials and air conditioning to create a residence that feels both sophisticated and welcoming. \r\n\r\n- Engineered timber flooring, bespoke cabinetry, premium stone finishes and luxurious 100% wool carpets deliver an exceptional standard of finish throughout.\r\n\r\n- Expansive open-plan kitchen, dining and living area forms the heart of the home, flowing seamlessly through full-height glazing to a generous covered loggia.\r\n\r\n- Three generous bedrooms, two beautifully appointed bathrooms and a double internal-access garage provide the perfect balance. \r\n\r\n- Enjoy morning walks along Milford Beach, cafés and boutique shopping in Milford Village, excellent local schools, and easy access to Takapuna and Auckland's CBD.\r\n\r\nDemand in the development has been strong, with two of the five residences sold unconditionally.\r\n\r\nSecure the lock-up-and-leave dream.\r\n\r\nIF YOU CAN'T REACH ANDREW DORREEN, PLEASE CONTACT HIS SALES ASSOCIATE ANNA JONES ON 021 489 171",
